@tradition harvest-supper
// Harvest supper: Harvest, week 7, Sunday dinner (day 231 in the first year), the day after a harvest morning (day 230).
// Long tables in the mess, everything from the garden. On that Sunday it takes the weekly Sunday dinner's place (the
// weekly designer's Sunday roast, if it's built: same deck, same time, and the rarer one wins). A meal tradition: those
// going eat dinner here (ties galley meal=dinner). The tally: crew vote for the best of the harvest with a token;
// the garden plants more of the winner next season. Design note: plans/trad-notes-seasons.md.
k: 476
title: Harvest supper
when: quarter week 7 sunday season harvest
at: 18:00-19:30
min: 30
prio: 1
jitter: 15
where: 3 room Mess hall: mess-seat
where: 3 room Mess hall: @long-table
where: 3 pool mess-seat
hold: none
who: cruz-tove always, brennan always, garden always, gardener 95%, garden-lover 90%, everyone 70%
anim: talk
host: cruz-tove
from: brennan
cake: yes
ties: galley meal=dinner dish=harvest-supper batch=60
ties: tally harvest-best choices=tomatoes|beans|squash|herbs
ties: decor harvestTables
invite: host=brennan odds=35% line="Harvest supper tonight. Long tables, all from the garden. Sit by me and tell me what's best."

meal: dinner
== mail
- Harvest supper tomorrow, {time}, in the mess: long tables and everything from the garden. Vote for the best of the harvest with your token. Pie after.

== ask
- Harvest supper tonight. I've saved room since breakfast.   #funny
- Long tables in the mess tonight. Everything on them grew here.
- Have you voted yet? I'm for the beans. The beans are underrated.   #funny
- Harvest supper at six. Sit with us?   #warm

== here
- Pass the squash. No, the other squash.   #funny
- Every bit of this grew a deck away from where you sleep.
- To the garden, and to the people who keep it.   #warm
- Leave room for the pie. Brennan made six.

== thanks
- You squeeze onto a long table for the harvest supper. Someone passes you a bowl, and then another.   #warm
- You drop your token in the jar for the best of the harvest. The table argues about it all the way to pie.   #funny

== chatter
- The tomatoes won the harvest vote again. I'll never understand it.   #funny
- Harvest supper is the one night the whole mess eats the same thing.
- Tove doesn't sit down at the harvest supper until everyone has a plate.   #warm
